<h4>49. <strong>How does a Slicer work in Excel?</strong></h4>
<p><em><strong>Ans.</strong></em> In MS Excel, Slicer is used to filter Pivot tables quickly. It is possible to connect multiple slicers to multiple pivot tables.</p>
<p>To add a slicer to the pivot, perform the following steps-</p>
<ul>
<li>Step 1: Create a pivot table</li>
<li>Step 2: Inside the pivot table, select any cell</li>
