<p>You can use the code below that takes a <em>kafkaGroup</em>, <em>kafkaAddress</em>, and topic to create <em>FlinkKafkaConsumer</em> that consumes data from a given topic as a <em>String</em> (because to decode data, you provide <em>SimpleStringSchema</em>). Do note that the number 001 in the code refers to the version of Kafka that you are using, and you may have to change it based on the version you are currently running.</p>
